# src/ is committed, as tree-sitter grammars usually do: eye compiles src/parser.c in through cgo
# (syntax/treesitter.go), so building eye needs no tree-sitter CLI. `tree-sitter generate` writes
# everything in src/ but scanner.c from grammar.js, and `task generated` checks it is current.

# Built parsers and debug output
*.so
*.dylib
*.wasm
/log.html
